\v 16 But¦124035 Ruth¦124036 replied¦124035, “\add Please\add* don't¦124037 insist that I leave¦124042 you and go back¦124043, because¦124045 wherever you go, I'll go \add with you\add* and wherever you live, I'll live \add there too\add*. Your¦124054 people \add are\add* my people, and your¦124056 god \add is\add* my god.
