\nb
\v 1 Now there was a relative¦124161 there of Naomi's deceased husband¦124163. His name¦124169 was Boaz¦124170 and¦124160 he was a very wealthy¦124166 man¦124164 from the same clan¦124167 as Elimelek¦124168 had been.
