\v 2 Ruth¦124173 the Moabitess said to Naomi¦124177, “Allow me¦124178 to go¦124178 to the countryside¦124181 and¦124172 pick up any heads of grain¦124186 that¦124182 the harvesters drop.\x + \xo 2:2: \xt Lev 19:9-10; Deu 24:19.\x* I'll¦124192 follow any harvester who seems kind.”
