\p
\v 3 So¦124201 Ruth left and went¦124201 to the countryside where she picked up heads of grain after the harvesters¦124206, and it¦124207 just so happened¦124207 that that part of the countryside belonged¦124211 to Boaz¦124211 who¦124212 was¦124213 Elimelek's¦124214 relative.
