\v 4 Just then¦124216, Boaz¦124218 arrived from¦124220 the town and¦124216 greeted the harvesters¦124223, “May Yahweh be¦124225 with¦124225 you,” to¦124227 which they¦124226 replied¦124222, “May Yahweh bless¦124228 you \add also\add*.”
