\v 20 “May he be blessed¦124541 by Yahweh,” responded¦124538 Naomi¦124539. “Yahweh \em hasn't\em* forgotten his kindness¦124548 towards \add us who are still\add* living¦124551 and¦124538 \add to our husbands who've\add* died¦124554.” And then¦124538 she¦124555 added, “That man¦124560 is a close¦124558 relative \add of Elimelek\add*. \add In fact,\add* he's one of those responsible for taking care of our family.”\x + \xo 2:20: \xt Lev 25:25.\x*
